  body: "# Winter Fuel Payment: the source’s winter 2025 scope\n\n## Authored interpretation\n\nChapter 39 introduces
    a Winter Fuel Payment section for winter 2025 onwards, based on circumstances in a qualifying week, with ordinary
    residence in England or Wales and further exclusions.\n\n## Scope and exceptions\n\nDMG 39900 says 15 September
    2025, while chapter 40’s replacement warning says 16 September 2025. This one-day boundary discrepancy is unresolved.
    Age or residence alone is insufficient; DMG 39911 lists exclusions. The source says EEA/Switzerland payment
    provisions expired on 1 April 2025. No present entitlement, tax recovery or territorial successor scheme is
    established.\n\n## Inspected passages\n\n- [DMG 39900, PDF page 63](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=63).\n\
    - [DMG 39901, PDF page 63](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=63).\n\
    - [DMG 39903, PDF page 63](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=63).\n\
    - [DMG 39904, PDF page 64](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=64).\n\
    - [DMG 39911, PDF page 64](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=64).\n\
    \n## Additional context\n\n- [Context: chapter 40, PDF page 10](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68d6a588620e762dc586644e/dmg-ch-40.pdf#page=10).\n\
    \n## Evidence and review status\n\nIndependent experimental interpretation of captured DWP guidance, not an
    official DWP document. Definitions and semantic associations are model-assisted proposals awaiting specialist
    review. No individual entitlement decision, medical conclusion, award calculation or executable rule is provided.\n\
    \nSource observation, listing-page update, printed revision, legal event and claimant-event dates are separate.
    Current legal applicability is unresolved. Page numbers are one-based PDF positions; machine extraction may
    damage reading order, characters and footnotes. No visual PDF or specialist acceptance is claimed.\n\n- `dmg-vol7-ch39`:
    PDF `ab13db0cf4d33fd90fb4cd8a90b909af568d39169f617f4b86b1037278d3fa9f`; extracted pages `625425d7933417f8895628354b1be65fc86df4d1f97a55acb13426d6cbe2b8a7`;
    acquired `2026-09-15T19:45:28.411887Z`.\n- `dmg-vol7-ch40`: PDF `9b76037acc6c9d2fc308b1cf7f834f2d023277e0a08757925e62255b3aa71dd3`;
    extracted pages `3e67a94776dd0edb568cbaca4d63bfef2587ca81bb5b154aad552d488c8de249`; acquired `2026-09-15T19:45:28.419769Z`.\n"
  resource: https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=63
